lted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 9063, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01BaDtz2aFt3xxzfEQwLF18n", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 11058, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Q5MU6jqqnSub47AskVNnY4", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 11358, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Q5MU6jqqnSub47AskVNnY4", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 11358, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Q5MU6jqqnSub47AskVNnY4", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 14110, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01UvMiFjvXNUwvr5TEUGED8j", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 18110, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01UvMiFjvXNUwvr5TEUGED8j", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 18110, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01UvMiFjvXNUwvr5TEUGED8j", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 19904, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RCowBBwawakW9xpYszLXpQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20204, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RCowBBwawakW9xpYszLXpQ", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20204, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RCowBBwawakW9xpYszLXpQ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 20204, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_018zZCd1j6VbmYtxec1BtYGs", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 20504, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_018zZCd1j6VbmYtxec1BtYGs", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 20504, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_018zZCd1j6VbmYtxec1BtYGs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 25017, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KrruBi2NaLpBY7gp6ax5b8", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks, rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left versions mixed across regions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging before it was promoted) and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55617, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KrruBi2NaLpBY7gp6ax5b8", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55617, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KrruBi2NaLpBY7gp6ax5b8", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 56988, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_0167aH3cQGyYZFX4LyKcdtcW", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57288, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_0167aH3cQGyYZFX4LyKcdtcW", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57288, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_0167aH3cQGyYZFX4LyKcdtcW", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62147, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident (INC-0001) is open, which pages the on-call engineer.\n\n1. **Diagnosis:** v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions on v2.3.1. I retried once, since rolling back to the same healthy version is safe, and it finished in all regions. The error rate is now 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to open it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. INC-0001 had been created, so I didn't send it again (that would have opened a duplicate and paged on-call twice). The summary describes the failure, the rollback and both attempts.\n\nTwo things are still open, and both are listed in the incident:\n- Finding out why v2.3.1 fails. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging but was promoted to production anyway.\n- Looking into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Q7MFv7GGkctBhDyHu5Z4BT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01DFLun2pcFzFojLCZg9aWw8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01BaDtz2aFt3xxzfEQwLF18n", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01Q5MU6jqqnSub47AskVNnY4", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback stopped partway: us-east is on v2.3.0, but us-west and eu-west are still on v2.3.1. Rolling back to the same healthy version again is safe, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01UvMiFjvXNUwvr5TEUGED8j", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01RCowBBwawakW9xpYszLXpQ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_018zZCd1j6VbmYtxec1BtYGs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KrruBi2NaLpBY7gp6ax5b8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks, rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 (latest deploy) was failing health checks in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), error rate 18%. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, which left versions mixed across regions. A retry finished the rollback in all regions. After the rollback, all regions run v2.3.0, the service is healthy, and the error rate is 0.2%. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure (v2.3.1-rc was also unhealthy in staging before it was promoted) and look into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_0167aH3cQGyYZFX4LyKcdtcW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again. The SEV2 incident (INC-0001) is open, which pages the on-call engineer.\n\n1. **Diagnosis:** v2.3.1, the latest deploy, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. The most recent release that was healthy in production is v2.3.0.\n2. **Rollback:** The first attempt stopped after us-east because of an orchestrator error, leaving us-east on v2.3.0 and the other two regions on v2.3.1. I retried once, since rolling back to the same healthy version is safe, and it finished in all regions. The error rate is now 0.2%.\n3. **Incident:** The request to open it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. INC-0001 had been created, so I didn't send it again (that would have opened a duplicate and paged on-call twice). The summary describes the failure, the rollback and both attempts.\n\nTwo things are still open, and both are listed in the incident:\n- Finding out why v2.3.1 fails. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) was also unhealthy in staging but was promoted to production anyway.\n- Looking into the orchestrator error that stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}